quo" -> Taps\," \, "rdquo" -> Marines' Hymn\," and \, "rdquo" -> God Bless 
 
America\," among other patriotic songs and jazz classics\, the evening brin
 
gs a fresh musical perspective to melodies that carry generations of histor
 
y and meaning. Expressive improvisation and rich harmonies create moments o
 
f reflection and celebration\, paying tribute to the courage\, dedication\,
 
 and sacrifice of our veterans. Join us at Catalina Jazz Club for an evenin
 
g of music\, gratitude\, and remembrance. Catalina Jazz Club 6725 West Suns
 
et Blvd. Hollywood\, CA 90028 *Two-item minimum required per person. Ticket
 
s & info: https://catalinajazzclub.com/tm-event/a-salute-in-jazz-a-veterans
 
-day-tribute-feat-hollywood-standard-quartet/
URL:https://catalinajazzclub.com/tm-event/a-salute-in-jazz-a-veterans-day-t
 
ribute-feat-hollywood-standard-quartet/
END:VEVENT
